      <a href="#late">Why am I always arriving late?</a>
      <a href="#what">What is a split step, and when exactly?</a>
      <a href="#does-it-work">Does it actually work?</a>
      <a href="#six">What are the six corners, and where is base?</a>
      <a href="#front">Getting to the two front corners</a>
      <a href="#back">Getting to the back two</a>
      <a href="#middle">The middle two</a>
